      "en": "As he sowed, some seed fell by the road, and the birdscame and devoured it.",
      "ko": "뿌릴쌔 더러는 길 가에 떨어지매 새들이 와서 먹어 버렸고",
      "source_text_hash": "ebc63b333ee6cd93de6ac901b3ae436bc94756a08ab6d91d043aadcaf3b12cbd",
      "translation_text_hash": "9471d360058a37c73b67b30e8f02aab741d502885cf4202b6acded9956133112",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "뿌릴쌔 더러는 길 가에 떨어지매 새들이 와서 먹어 버렸고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
