      "en": "When the sun had risen, it was scorched; and because it had no root, it withered away.",
      "ko": "해가 돋은 후에 타져서 뿌리가 없으므로 말랐고",
      "source_text_hash": "93720c40b30b19cc9126baf13f54ca6a65f87e578300caf63c272d9c85d432a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "b0e25a7d3e8889b2d85ef482a6b1a26547ee35a54a4e192e241524870657d703",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
