      "en": "He said to them, “To you is given the mystery of God’s Kingdom, but to those who are outside, all things are done in parables,",
      "ko": "이르시되 하나님 나라의 비밀을 너희에게는 주었으나 외인에게는 모든 것을 비유로 하나니",
      "source_text_hash": "c1342379a50bf5d8345c6d09750296098b6992198dfd3b5d8f027aabfab1b2f8",
      "translation_text_hash": "575645bee54d733e457aee17509bd5d33274693f9bfb29ace35409716bed0159",
