      "en": "They have no root in themselves, but are short-lived. When oppression or persecution arises because of the word, immediately they stumble.",
      "ko": "그 속에 뿌리가 없어 잠간 견디다가 말씀을 인하여 환난이나 핍박이 일어나는 때에는 곧 넘어지는 자요",
      "source_text_hash": "61a8924fa7121b93119148ead088ba08b2fad92935f833619a6660373278e527",
      "translation_text_hash": "f065bfd3087fdc8651282cb42bd9e84bc75be7930d797eb78821c4c92253f21b",
