      "en": "Others are those who are sown among the thorns. These are those who have heard the word,",
      "ko": "또 어떤이는 가시떨기에 뿌리우는 자니 이들은 말씀을 듣되",
      "source_text_hash": "892d4142dc3ccb006e0f51deee31a59ce9e543ca6086195b2a736cd04420f64a",
      "translation_text_hash": "473e75689bbfc34797fc7c85b666643d31ec684a3a190bf181ee8016e641d28a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 어떤이는 가시떨기에 뿌리우는 자니 이들은 말씀을 듣되"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "473e75689bbfc34797fc7c85b666643d31ec684a3a190bf181ee8016e641d28a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MRK:4:19",
