      "en": "and the cares of this age, and the deceitfulness of riches, and the lusts of other things entering in choke the word, and it becomes unfruitful.",
      "ko": "세상의 염려와 재리의 유혹과 기타 욕심이 들어와 말씀을 막아 결실치 못하게 되는 자요",
      "source_text_hash": "fbc76f36c2da5f0cb2306ab602a9d2d70e7d3a3f009f1edf80e3c2b7984bbd9d",
      "translation_text_hash": "61de92813867a784aab12bb64eb8a159607d0fe6b4b81f3d2dfd1a3f75ec25c7",
