      "en": "Those which were sown on the good ground are those who hear the word, accept it, and bear fruit, some thirty times, some sixty times, and some one hundred times.”",
      "ko": "좋은 땅에 뿌리웠다는 것은 곧 말씀을 듣고 받아 삼십배와 육십배와 백배의 결실을 하는 자니라",
      "source_text_hash": "31cc975494fcc8c18df40ca7705ffab71e97b0a2ade74f6e94d929e65aed83e4",
      "translation_text_hash": "03b38db2335ba5aa4795eb04c0009617966d6ff397ae2f691d6ba37577c8fb48",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "좋은 땅에 뿌리웠다는 것은 곧 말씀을 듣고 받아 삼십배와 육십배와 백배의 결실을 하는 자니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "03b38db2335ba5aa4795eb04c0009617966d6ff397ae2f691d6ba37577c8fb48"
      ]
