      "en": "For whoever has, to him more will be given; and he who doesn’t have, even that which he has will be taken away from him.”",
      "ko": "있는 자는 받을 것이요 없는 자는 그 있는 것까지 빼앗기리라",
      "source_text_hash": "344193c6a390ec92b9dbc045956c0075dd497ab055191d8b64a3e9dcadd0515d",
      "translation_text_hash": "c8fdbe3f332897cc4d45e16f14f028e31395c27638f76de18cfff7f9727232bf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
